# 🔎 SINGASCOPE — OSINT Investigation Chatbot

SINGASCOPE is a Python-based **Open-Source Intelligence (OSINT) chatbot** designed to assist users in gathering and organizing publicly available information for investigative and research purposes.

The project was developed as part of my cybersecurity internship and focuses on combining **OSINT concepts, Python, web-based information gathering, and a simple interactive interface**.

## 🚀 Features

* 🔍 OSINT-focused information gathering
* 🤖 Interactive chatbot-style interface
* 🌐 Web-based user interface
* 🐍 Developed using Python
* 🎨 Tailwind CSS-based frontend
* 📊 Organizes publicly available information for easier analysis
* 🧩 Menu-driven functionality for different investigation tasks

