## ⚙️ Installation

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/SINGASCOPE.git
cd SINGASCOPE
```

### 2. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3. Run the application

```bash
python main.py
```

## 🧠 How It Works

SINGASCOPE follows a simple OSINT workflow:

```text
User Input
    ↓
Investigation Query
    ↓
Information Gathering
    ↓
Processing / Organization
    ↓
Results
```

The system is intended to help users work with **publicly available information** in a structured way.

